2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְבֵיתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Haggai 1:9\" href=\"/Haggai.1.9\">Hg 1:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לָרַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.7\">Is 59:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.16\">Pr 1:16</a>; acc. loc. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.6\">1 S 20:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.22\">17:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:48\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.48\">48</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">לִקְרַאת</span>); ב loc. <em>on</em> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ב</span> II. <strong>2</strong>), of horses <a data-ref=\"Amos 6:12\" href=\"/Amos.6.12\">Am 6:12</a>, locusts <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:9\" href=\"/Joel.2.9\">Jo 2:9</a>; <em>into</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.10\">Pr 18:10</a> (fig.); <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> loc. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.12\">1 S 4:12</a>, so MT <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.12\">2 K 23:12</a> (= <em>he went quickly thence</em>, but text perhaps corrupt, v. Kit Benz, and cf.> <strong>Hiph.</strong> infr.); <span dir=\"rtl\">אַחֲרֵי</span> pers. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 18:22\" href=\"/II_Samuel.18.22\">2 S 18:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.20\">1 K 19:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:20\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.20\">2 K 5:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:21\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.21\">21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:4\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.4\">Ct 1:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד</span> pers. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:22\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.22\">2 K 4:22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לִפְנֵי</span> pers. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.1\">2 S 15:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.5\">1 K 1:5</a> (both of royal escort, 2), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:46\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.46\">18:46</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד</span> loc.), <span dir=\"rtl\">לִפְנֵי</span> rei <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 8:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.8.11\">1 S 8:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵת</span> pers. accomp. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 12:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.12.5\">Je 12:5</a>; c. acc. of way, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹרַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 19:6\" href=\"/Psalms.19.6\">ψ 19:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דֶּרֶךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 18:23\" href=\"/II_Samuel.18.23\">2 S 18:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:132\" href=\"/Psalms.119.132\">ψ 119:132</a> (fig.); as prelim., + inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִקְרַאת</span> <em>run to meet</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:2\" href=\"/Genesis.18.2\">Gn 18:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:17\" href=\"/Genesis.24.17\">24:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:13\" href=\"/Genesis.29.13\">29:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:4\" href=\"/Genesis.33.4\">33:4</a> (all J), <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:26\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.26\">2 K 4:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:31\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.31\">Je 51:31</a> + vb. fin. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:28\" href=\"/Genesis.24.28\">Gn 24:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:12\" href=\"/Genesis.29.12\">29:12</a> (both J), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:27\" href=\"/Numbers.11.27\">Nu 11:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:19\" href=\"/Joshua.8.19\">Jos 8:19</a> (both JE), <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:21\" href=\"/Judges.7.21\">Ju 7:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 13:10\" href=\"/Judges.13.10\">13:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:23\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.23\">1 S 10:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:51\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.51\">17:51</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 18:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.18.19\">2 S 18:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 59:5\" href=\"/Psalms.59.5\">ψ 59:5</a>; as imv. + imv. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:36\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.36\">1 S 20:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 2:8\" href=\"/Zechariah.2.8\">Zc 2:8</a>; abs. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:36\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.36\">1 S 20:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:31\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.31\">Is 40:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.12\">2 Ch 23:12</a> (v. <strong>2 a</strong>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 4:12\" hre